Training data notice

The pretraining data included third-party material whose own terms differ from
the Apache License. Among them:

- A Tamil translation of Stanford Alpaca (abhinand/tamil-alpaca). Its Hugging
  Face card gives the licence as GPL-3.0. The upstream Stanford Alpaca data is
  licensed CC BY-NC 4.0, and Stanford asks that models trained on it be used for
  research purposes only.
- Tamil Orca (azharmo/tamil-orca), Apache-2.0, built from answers generated by
  GPT-4 and Gemini, whose providers have their own terms for model outputs.
- Tamil text produced with the bodhan-ai/indic-ocr model (Indic Open Model
  License) and with Sarvam AI's OCR API (Sarvam terms of service), whose terms
  address training models on their output.

The technical report describes these sources and their share of the training
data (sections "Data" and "Frontier-model text and upstream terms"). We provide this information so that users can assess it for
their own use. It is not legal advice.
